L(H) - L(H_true) in bits = log2 posterior odds (H_true : H); positive keeps T_Ind whole.
Template prior: 5 bits per symbol, charged for EVERY listed template (corrected; referee m1).
H_root = Q + all 7 root templates; H_used = Q + the root templates of the roots that occur (the split H_F of
app:many:mdl, F = main connectives of the induction data; index alphabet restricted to them).
Seeds: random.Random(n) for each n (as in u7).
